.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
rsconnect/

# Analyst data and outputs live in the session's temporary work folder, never
#   in this repository. The one survey file that belongs here is the
#   demonstration data the app ships with. A directory ignored outright cannot
#   have a file re-admitted inside it, so data/ is ignored by its contents
#   (/data/*) and the demo file is then let back in by name. Ignoring data/
#   itself is what silently kept the demo off GitHub once before.
*.sav
*.zsav
*.dta
*.parquet
*.rds
/data/*
!/data/ECU_2023_LAPOP_AmericasBarometer_v1.0_w.sav

output/
cache/
/decisions/
/dict/
